{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChTxUr3qQ6YFNa8oMrJc6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NZBUYZkFLKgiG1o3D1yBHB","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/kalethabh/Anuncios con IA/temp/_landings/canela-de-ceylan-08bc42/revision.json","content":"{\n  \"cambios\": {\n    \"producto.marca\": \"Metabolae\",\n    \"comparacion.nuestraSub\": \"De Metabolae\",\n    \"oferta.combos.tres.nombre\": \"Tratamiento completo x3 meses — Tu rutina diaria con la canela verdadera, con constancia y a tu ritmo\"\n  },\n  \"imagenes\": [\n    {\n      \"slot\": \"galeria-01\",\n      \"prompt\": \"Vertical 942x1670 e-commerce hero graphic, clean warm off-white background (#FFFBF6), single brand color burnt cinnamon orange (#B3561C) for highlight boxes, icons and seals, near-black text, bold condensed sans-serif. TOP: giant uppercase headline in 3 lines, key words inside cinnamon-orange highlight boxes with white text: “DALE A TU TARDE” / “UN RESPIRO” / “DEL ANTOJO.” Below it, one line in dark text: “La canela verdadera de Sri Lanka, en cápsula blanda que tomas con tu comida.” Then 2 small rounded dark seals side by side with icons: “SIN GLUTEN” and “SIN OGM”. LEFT COLUMN: 4 stacked items, each a cinnamon-orange circle with a simple line icon plus bold title and small line: icon of a cinnamon stick “CANELA VERDADERA” / “Canela de Ceilán, no la común.”; icon of a plate “CON TU COMIDA” / “En tu comida principal.”; icon of a capsule “CÁPSULA BLANDA” / “Sin preparar nada.”; icon of a bag “VA CONTIGO” / “Cabe en tu cartera.” RIGHT SIDE: a Colombian woman around 48 years old, warm mestiza skin, shoulder-length dark wavy hair, natural makeup, wearing comfortable fitted jeans and a soft cream blouse, standing 3/4 body, relaxed confident smile, light and energetic posture, holding a small lunch plate or a cup near her. Three cinnamon-orange label tags with thin pointer lines point around her: “CANELA DE CEILÁN”, “CON TU COMIDA”, “A TU RITMO”. BOTTOM RIGHT: the real product from the reference photo standing on a round cinnamon-orange podium: white matte stand-up zip pouch with the brand “Metabolae”, big brown title “Canela de Ceilán”, a burnt-orange bottom band with cinnamon sticks and the tag “30 CÁPSULAS BLANDAS” — reproduce the packaging exactly, do not redesign it; a few glossy brown soft capsules and two cinnamon sticks at its base. BOTTOM LEFT: big text “TU RUTINA DIARIA” with “DIARIA” in a cinnamon-orange box, and a tiny line below “con constancia y según la etiqueta”. No numbers of weeks or days, no guarantee seal, no ratings, no testimonials, no other brands. All text in Spanish, sharp and legible.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"slot\": \"galeria-02\",\n      \"prompt\": \"Square 1200x1200 product ingredients graphic, soft warm off-white background (#FFFBF6) with a subtle warm gradient, clean premium style. TOP: big bold two-line headline, first line near-black “Lo mejor de la canela”, second line in cinnamon orange (#B3561C) “En cada cápsula”. CENTER: the real product from the reference photo, white matte stand-up pouch “Metabolae” “Canela de Ceilán” with burnt-orange bottom band and “30 CÁPSULAS BLANDAS” tag, reproduced exactly, standing upright, soft shadow. AROUND IT: 4 labels, two on each side, each a small round photo inside a thin cinnamon-orange ring plus a pill-shaped light cinnamon label with bold dark uppercase text: left top round photo of rolled thin layered Ceylon cinnamon quills “CANELA DE CEILÁN”; left bottom round photo of a small clear glass with a drop of clear golden oil “ACEITE MCT” (no coconut); right top round photo of green cinnamon tree leaves and bark in a tropical plantation “ORIGEN SRI LANKA”; right bottom round photo of glossy amber-brown soft gel capsules “CÁPSULA BLANDA”. No other ingredients, no numbers, no other brands. Text in Spanish, crisp and legible.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"slot\": \"galeria-03\",\n      \"prompt\": \"Square 1200x1200 product graphic, warm off-white background (#FFFBF6), minimal and modern. TOP CENTER: big bold two-line headline in near-black with highlighted words in cinnamon orange (#B3561C): “Tu *cápsula*.” / “Tu rutina *cuenta*.” (the words “cápsula” and “cuenta” in cinnamon orange, no asterisks shown). LEFT: the real product from the reference photo, white matte stand-up pouch “Metabolae” “Canela de Ceilán” with burnt-orange bottom band, reproduced exactly, tilted about 15 degrees to the left, with a few glossy brown soft capsules spilling out in front. RIGHT: 5 horizontal rounded strips in a light cinnamon tint fading to transparent, each with dark text and a thin cinnamon-orange line icon at the end: “Un respiro para tu tarde” (clock icon); “Cápsula blanda” (capsule icon); “Se toma con tu comida principal” (plate icon); “Cabe en tu cartera” (bag icon); “Canela de Ceilán de Sri Lanka” (leaf icon). BOTTOM: small italic gray note: “Suplemento dietario. Los resultados pueden variar. No reemplaza un tratamiento médico.” Text in Spanish, legible.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"slot\": \"galeria-06\",\n      \"prompt\": \"Square 1200x1200 benefits graphic, warm off-white background (#FFFBF6). TOP: bold uppercase near-black headline in two lines: “POR QUÉ ESTA” / “CANELA ES DISTINTA”. Below, 3 wide rounded cards stacked vertically in cinnamon orange (#B3561C), each with a white circular line icon on the left, a bold white sentence and a lighter white explanation line: card 1 cinnamon stick icon, bold “Es la canela verdadera”, line “Canela de Ceilán de Sri Lanka, no la común de la tienda.”; card 2 calendar icon, bold “Pensada para tu rutina diaria”, line “La canela de Ceilán trae solo trazas de cumarina.”; card 3 plate icon, bold “Con tu comida, sin preparar nada”, line “Una cápsula blanda en tu comida principal.” Small product pouch from the reference photo (white “Metabolae” “Canela de Ceilán”, reproduced exactly) peeking at the bottom right corner. No people names, no quotes, no stars. Text in Spanish, legible.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"slot\": \"galeria-09\",\n      \"prompt\": \"Square 1200x1200 how-to graphic, light off-white background (#FFFBF6) with soft warm cinnamon glow in the corners. TOP LEFT: label in a cinnamon-orange (#B3561C) highlight box with white bold text “3 PASOS SENCILLOS”. CENTER: the real product from the reference photo, white matte stand-up pouch “Metabolae” “Canela de Ceilán”, reproduced exactly, slightly tilted, with three glossy brown soft capsules beside it. Around the product, a large hand-drawn circular path of cinnamon-orange arrows connecting 3 steps: top right “PASO 1” bold and below “Revisa la etiqueta del empaque”; bottom left “PASO 2” and “Tómala con tu comida, según la etiqueta”; bottom right “PASO 3” and “Sé constante, a tu ritmo”. Near-black clean sans-serif text in Spanish, legible.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"pendientes\": [\n    \"La dosis no aparece en el empaque de frente. Confirma cuántas cápsulas van al día y si una bolsa dura un mes, porque los combos dicen 1, 2 y 3 meses.\",\n    \"El correo de la tienda está vacío y la página promete «Atención por correo». Agrega tu correo antes de publicar.\",\n    \"Confirma de dónde sale el aceite MCT (casi siempre del coco) y de qué está hecha la cápsula. Por ahora la imagen no muestra coco.\",\n    \"Tienes que tener tus políticas de envío, cambios y devoluciones publicadas, porque la página las menciona.\",\n    \"Las secciones de reseñas y experiencias deben quedar ocultas hasta que tengas reseñas reales con foto.\",\n    \"No pautes con promesas de azúcar, glucosa ni plazos de resultados. Revisa con tu médico la advertencia para quien toma medicamentos.\"\n  ],\n  \"resumen\": \"Quité de la imagen principal el «¡En 4 a 8 semanas!» y las etiquetas de «menos antojo», «energía pareja» y «más liviana», porque eran promesas sin respaldo y chocaban con las preguntas, que dicen que no hay plazo garantizado. También suavicé el nombre del combo de 3 y cambié «una cápsula» por «según la etiqueta», porque todavía no sabemos la dosis. Puse Metabolae como marca, porque es la que aparece en la bolsa. Quité el coco de la imagen de ingredientes hasta que confirmes de dónde sale el aceite.\"\n}\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":21433,"cache_read_input_tokens":4624,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":21433},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8df103ee-f8c9-4ed6-991d-7570894a6e58","uuid":"d4f8a515-00dd-426e-b34d-7ccc68059c1f","timestamp":"2026-11-27T19:08:07.895Z","request_id":"req_011ChTxUqv9ZsXcY9QaEia6s","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01NZBUYZkFLKgiG1o3D1yBHB":{"file_path":"/Users/kalethabh/Anuncios con IA/temp/_landings/canela-de-ceylan-08bc42/revision.json","content":"{\n  \"cambios\": {\n    \"producto.marca\": \"Metabolae\",\n    \"comparacion.nuestraSub\": \"De Metabolae\",\n    \"oferta.combos.tres.nombre\": \"Tratamiento completo x3 meses — Tu rutina diaria con la canela verdadera, con constancia y a tu ritmo\"\n  },\n  \"imagenes\": [\n    {\n      \"slot\": \"galeria-01\",\n      \"prompt\": \"Vertical 942x1670 e-commerce hero graphic, clean warm off-white background (#FFFBF6), single brand color burnt cinnamon orange (#B3561C) for highlight boxes, icons and seals, near-black text, bold condensed sans-serif. TOP: giant uppercase headline in 3 lines, key words inside cinnamon-orange highlight boxes with white text: “DALE A TU TARDE” / “UN RESPIRO” / “DEL ANTOJO.” Below it, one line in dark text: “La canela verdadera de Sri Lanka, en cápsula blanda que tomas con tu comida.” Then 2 small rounded dark seals side by side with icons: “SIN GLUTEN” and “SIN OGM”. LEFT COLUMN: 4 stacked items, each a cinnamon-orange circle with a simple line icon plus bold title and small line: icon of a cinnamon stick “CANELA VERDADERA” / “Canela de Ceilán, no la común.”; icon of a plate “CON TU COMIDA” / “En tu comida principal.”; icon of a capsule “CÁPSULA BLANDA” / “Sin preparar nada.”; icon of a bag “VA CONTIGO” / “Cabe en tu cartera.” RIGHT SIDE: a Colombian woman around 48 years old, warm mestiza skin, shoulder-length dark wavy hair, natural makeup, wearing comfortable fitted jeans and a soft cream blouse, standing 3/4 body, relaxed confident smile, light and energetic posture, holding a small lunch plate or a cup near her. Three cinnamon-orange label tags with thin pointer lines point around her: “CANELA DE CEILÁN”, “CON TU COMIDA”, “A TU RITMO”. BOTTOM RIGHT: the real product from the reference photo standing on a round cinnamon-orange podium: white matte stand-up zip pouch with the brand “Metabolae”, big brown title “Canela de Ceilán”, a burnt-orange bottom band with cinnamon sticks and the tag “30 CÁPSULAS BLANDAS” — reproduce the packaging exactly, do not redesign it; a few glossy brown soft capsules and two cinnamon sticks at its base. BOTTOM LEFT: big text “TU RUTINA DIARIA” with “DIARIA” in a cinnamon-orange box, and a tiny line below “con constancia y según la etiqueta”. No numbers of weeks or days, no guarantee seal, no ratings, no testimonials, no other brands. All text in Spanish, sharp and legible.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"slot\": \"galeria-02\",\n      \"prompt\": \"Square 1200x1200 product ingredients graphic, soft warm off-white background (#FFFBF6) with a subtle warm gradient, clean premium style. TOP: big bold two-line headline, first line near-black “Lo mejor de la canela”, second line in cinnamon orange (#B3561C) “En cada cápsula”. CENTER: the real product from the reference photo, white matte stand-up pouch “Metabolae” “Canela de Ceilán” with burnt-orange bottom band and “30 CÁPSULAS BLANDAS” tag, reproduced exactly, standing upright, soft shadow. AROUND IT: 4 labels, two on each side, each a small round photo inside a thin cinnamon-orange ring plus a pill-shaped light cinnamon label with bold dark uppercase text: left top round photo of rolled thin layered Ceylon cinnamon quills “CANELA DE CEILÁN”; left bottom round photo of a small clear glass with a drop of clear golden oil “ACEITE MCT” (no coconut); right top round photo of green cinnamon tree leaves and bark in a tropical plantation “ORIGEN SRI LANKA”; right bottom round photo of glossy amber-brown soft gel capsules “CÁPSULA BLANDA”. No other ingredients, no numbers, no other brands. Text in Spanish, crisp and legible.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"slot\": \"galeria-03\",\n      \"prompt\": \"Square 1200x1200 product graphic, warm off-white background (#FFFBF6), minimal and modern. TOP CENTER: big bold two-line headline in near-black with highlighted words in cinnamon orange (#B3561C): “Tu *cápsula*.” / “Tu rutina *cuenta*.” (the words “cápsula” and “cuenta” in cinnamon orange, no asterisks shown). LEFT: the real product from the reference photo, white matte stand-up pouch “Metabolae” “Canela de Ceilán” with burnt-orange bottom band, reproduced exactly, tilted about 15 degrees to the left, with a few glossy brown soft capsules spilling out in front. RIGHT: 5 horizontal rounded strips in a light cinnamon tint fading to transparent, each with dark text and a thin cinnamon-orange line icon at the end: “Un respiro para tu tarde” (clock icon); “Cápsula blanda” (capsule icon); “Se toma con tu comida principal” (plate icon); “Cabe en tu cartera” (bag icon); “Canela de Ceilán de Sri Lanka” (leaf icon). BOTTOM: small italic gray note: “Suplemento dietario. Los resultados pueden variar. No reemplaza un tratamiento médico.” Text in Spanish, legible.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"slot\": \"galeria-06\",\n      \"prompt\": \"Square 1200x1200 benefits graphic, warm off-white background (#FFFBF6). TOP: bold uppercase near-black headline in two lines: “POR QUÉ ESTA” / “CANELA ES DISTINTA”. Below, 3 wide rounded cards stacked vertically in cinnamon orange (#B3561C), each with a white circular line icon on the left, a bold white sentence and a lighter white explanation line: card 1 cinnamon stick icon, bold “Es la canela verdadera”, line “Canela de Ceilán de Sri Lanka, no la común de la tienda.”; card 2 calendar icon, bold “Pensada para tu rutina diaria”, line “La canela de Ceilán trae solo trazas de cumarina.”; card 3 plate icon, bold “Con tu comida, sin preparar nada”, line “Una cápsula blanda en tu comida principal.” Small product pouch from the reference photo (white “Metabolae” “Canela de Ceilán”, reproduced exactly) peeking at the bottom right corner. No people names, no quotes, no stars. Text in Spanish, legible.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"slot\": \"galeria-09\",\n      \"prompt\": \"Square 1200x1200 how-to graphic, light off-white background (#FFFBF6) with soft warm cinnamon glow in the corners. TOP LEFT: label in a cinnamon-orange (#B3561C) highlight box with white bold text “3 PASOS SENCILLOS”. CENTER: the real product from the reference photo, white matte stand-up pouch “Metabolae” “Canela de Ceilán”, reproduced exactly, slightly tilted, with three glossy brown soft capsules beside it. Around the product, a large hand-drawn circular path of cinnamon-orange arrows connecting 3 steps: top right “PASO 1” bold and below “Revisa la etiqueta del empaque”; bottom left “PASO 2” and “Tómala con tu comida, según la etiqueta”; bottom right “PASO 3” and “Sé constante, a tu ritmo”. Near-black clean sans-serif text in Spanish, legible.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"pendientes\": [\n    \"La dosis no aparece en el empaque de frente. Confirma cuántas cápsulas van al día y si una bolsa dura un mes, porque los combos dicen 1, 2 y 3 meses.\",\n    \"El correo de la tienda está vacío y la página promete «Atención por correo». Agrega tu correo antes de publicar.\",\n    \"Confirma de dónde sale el aceite MCT (casi siempre del coco) y de qué está hecha la cápsula. Por ahora la imagen no muestra coco.\",\n    \"Tienes que tener tus políticas de envío, cambios y devoluciones publicadas, porque la página las menciona.\",\n    \"Las secciones de reseñas y experiencias deben quedar ocultas hasta que tengas reseñas reales con foto.\",\n    \"No pautes con promesas de azúcar, glucosa ni plazos de resultados. Revisa con tu médico la advertencia para quien toma medicamentos.\"\n  ],\n  \"resumen\": \"Quité de la imagen principal el «¡En 4 a 8 semanas!» y las etiquetas de «menos antojo», «energía pareja» y «más liviana», porque eran promesas sin respaldo y chocaban con las preguntas, que dicen que no hay plazo garantizado. También suavicé el nombre del combo de 3 y cambié «una cápsula» por «según la etiqueta», porque todavía no sabemos la dosis. Puse Metabolae como marca, porque es la que aparece en la bolsa. Quité el coco de la imagen de ingredientes hasta que confirmes de dónde sale el aceite.\"\n}\n"}}}
